---
---

<section class="section-shell section-deferred research-proof">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="mb-[1.7rem] grid gap-[0.45rem]">
      <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-[var(--color-text-primary)]">
        Research Pressure, Not Atmosphere
      </h2>
      <p class="section-subhead">
        The language keeps improving because the science keeps forcing it to become more honest: PBPK, octonions, neuroimaging, and standards-bound uncertainty work all push on the compiler at once.
      </p>
      <p class="text-sm text-[var(--color-text-tertiary)] max-w-[64ch]">
        This storefront is now instrumented for production Web Vitals on Vercel as well, so the claims layer is expected to stay fast enough to be credible.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid gap-4 lg:grid-cols-[1fr_1fr] xl:grid-cols-[1fr_1fr_auto]">
      <!-- Papers -->
      <div class="glass glass-specular rounded-[var(--radius-xl)] p-[1.15rem] grid gap-[0.7rem]">
        <h3 class="text-sm font-[650] tracking-[0.08em] uppercase text-[var(--color-text-tertiary)]">Published Papers</h3>

        <article class="paper-entry">
          <span class="paper-tag">Theory</span>
          <h4>Ollivier-Ricci Curvature for Complex Networks</h4>
          <p class="paper-venue">Published &mdash; 3 papers on ORC theory, semantic networks, and biomedical applications</p>
        </article>

        <article class="paper-entry">
          <span class="paper-tag tag-submitted">Submitted</span>
          <h4>The 168 Theorem: Nonzero Octonion Basis Associators</h4>
          <p class="paper-venue">Advances in Applied Clifford Algebras &mdash; 2026</p>
          <p class="paper-detail">168 = |PSL(2,7)| nonzero basis associators. Binary {'{0,2}'} norm property. Fano plane classification.</p>
        </article>

        <article class="paper-entry">
          <span class="paper-tag tag-active">In Progress</span>
          <h4>Epistemic PBPK: GUM-Through-ODE for Drug Dosing</h4>
          <p class="paper-venue">Master&rsquo;s Dissertation &mdash; Biomaterials &amp; Regenerative Medicine</p>
          <p class="paper-detail">GUM vs Monte Carlo validated: &sigma; ratio 0.97, 94% coverage on rapamycin 3-compartment PBPK.</p>
        </article>
      </div>

      <!-- Stats + ML -->
      <div class="grid gap-4 content-start">
        <!-- Verified Artifacts -->
        <div class="glass glass-specular rounded-[var(--radius-xl)] p-[1.15rem] grid gap-[0.6rem]">
          <h3 class="text-sm font-[650] tracking-[0.08em] uppercase text-[var(--color-text-tertiary)]">Hard Signals</h3>
          <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-3">
            <div class="text-center">
              <div class="text-2xl font-bold text-[var(--color-text-primary)]">2,350+</div>
              <div class="text-xs text-[var(--color-text-secondary)]">Commits</div>
            </div>
            <div class="text-center">
              <div class="text-2xl font-bold text-[var(--color-text-primary)]">gen2=gen3</div>
              <div class="text-xs text-[var(--color-text-secondary)]">Self-hosting fixed point</div>
            </div>
            <div class="text-center">
              <div class="text-2xl font-bold text-[var(--color-text-primary)]">743</div>
              <div class="text-xs text-[var(--color-text-secondary)]">Stdlib files</div>
            </div>
            <div class="text-center">
              <div class="text-2xl font-bold text-[var(--color-text-primary)]">1,003+</div>
              <div class="text-xs text-[var(--color-text-secondary)]">E-graph rewrite rules</div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- ML / Epistemic Computing -->
        <div class="glass rounded-[var(--radius-xl)] p-[1.15rem] grid gap-[0.6rem]">
          <h3 class="text-sm font-[650] tracking-[0.08em] uppercase text-[var(--color-text-tertiary)]">Epistemic ML</h3>
          <div class="grid gap-2">
            <div class="ml-entry">
              <span class="ml-arch">Transformer</span>
              <span class="ml-detail">MHA + FFN + LayerNorm + GUM &mdash; 2,096 params</span>
            </div>
            <div class="ml-entry">
              <span class="ml-arch">O-SSM</span>
              <span class="ml-detail">Octonion State Space Model &mdash; 86K-param LM, backprop</span>
            </div>
            <div class="ml-entry">
              <span class="ml-arch">E-KAN</span>
              <span class="ml-detail">Epistemic Kolmogorov-Arnold Network &mdash; per-edge GUM</span>
            </div>
            <div class="ml-entry">
              <span class="ml-arch">Classifier</span>
              <span class="ml-detail">MLP 4&rarr;16&rarr;8&rarr;1 &mdash; file I/O, 100% accuracy</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <p class="text-xs text-[var(--color-text-tertiary)]">
            All native x86-64 ELF. No Python. No PyTorch. Full backpropagation with GUM uncertainty.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Standards + Author -->
      <div class="grid gap-4 content-start xl:max-w-[240px]">
        <div class="glass glass-specular rounded-[var(--radius-xl)] p-[1.15rem] grid gap-[0.6rem]">
          <h3 class="text-sm font-[650] tracking-[0.08em] uppercase text-[var(--color-text-tertiary)]">Standards</h3>
          <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2">
            <span class="compliance-badge">
              <svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="2"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9 12.75L11.25 15 15 9.75M21 12a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z" /></svg>
              GUM (JCGM 100:2008)
            </span>
            <span class="compliance-badge">
              <svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="2"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9 12.75L11.25 15 15 9.75M21 12a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z" /></svg>
              ISO 17025
            </span>
            <span class="compliance-badge">
              <svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="2"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9 12.75L11.25 15 15 9.75M21 12a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z" /></svg>
              CONSORT
            </span>
            <span class="compliance-badge">
              <svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="2"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9 12.75L11.25 15 15 9.75M21 12a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z" /></svg>
              OWL 2
            </span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- GUM Validation -->
        <div class="glass rounded-[var(--radius-xl)] p-[1.15rem] grid gap-[0.5rem]">
          <h3 class="text-sm font-[650] tracking-[0.08em] uppercase text-[var(--color-text-tertiary)]">GUM Validated</h3>
          <div class="grid gap-1.5">
            <div class="validation-row">
              <span class="validation-label">PBPK ODE</span>
              <span class="validation-value good">&sigma; ratio 0.97</span>
            </div>
            <div class="validation-row">
              <span class="validation-label">PBPK coverage</span>
              <span class="validation-value good">94%</span>
            </div>
            <div class="validation-row">
              <span class="validation-label">E-KAN NN</span>
              <span class="validation-value ok">1.5x conservative</span>
            </div>
            <div class="validation-row">
              <span class="validation-label">E-KAN coverage</span>
              <span class="validation-value good">99.8%</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <p class="text-xs text-[var(--color-text-tertiary)]">
            GUM vs Monte Carlo (N=200&ndash;500). Finite-difference Jacobian through RK4 and neural network.
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Author -->
        <div class="glass rounded-[var(--radius-xl)] p-[1.15rem] grid gap-[0.5rem]">
          <h3 class="text-sm font-[650] tracking-[0.08em] uppercase text-[var(--color-text-tertiary)]">Author</h3>
          <div class="grid gap-1.5">
            <p class="text-sm text-[var(--color-text-primary)] font-semibold">Demetrios Chiuratto Agourakis</p>
            <p class="text-xs text-[var(--color-text-secondary)]">PUC-SP &middot; S&atilde;o Leopoldo Mandic</p>
            <a href="https://orcid.org/0009-0001-8671-8878" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"
              class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs text-[var(--color-accent-teal)] hover:text-[var(--color-text-primary)] transition-colors">
              <svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M12 0C5.372 0 0 5.372 0 12s5.372 12 12 12 12-5.372 12-12S18.628 0 12 0zM7.369 4.378c.525 0 .947.431.947.947s-.422.947-.947.947a.95.95 0 01-.947-.947c0-.525.422-.947.947-.947zm-.722 3.038h1.444v10.041H6.647V7.416zm3.562 0h3.9c3.712 0 5.344 2.653 5.344 5.025 0 2.578-2.016 5.025-5.325 5.025h-3.919V7.416zm1.444 1.303v7.444h2.297c3.272 0 4.022-2.484 4.022-3.722 0-1.847-1.188-3.722-3.931-3.722h-2.388z"/></svg>
              ORCID Profile
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .paper-entry {
    display: grid;
    gap: 0.25rem;
  }

  .paper-entry h4 {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--color-text-primary);
  }

  .paper-venue {
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    color: var(--color-text-secondary);
  }

  .paper-detail {
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    color: var(--color-text-tertiary);
  }

  .paper-tag {
    display: inline-flex;
    width: fit-content;
    padding: 0.15rem 0.5rem;
    border-radius: var(--radius-full);
    font-size: 0.65rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-accent-green) 18%, transparent);
    color: var(--color-accent-green);
    border: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-accent-green) 30%, transparent);
  }

  .paper-tag.tag-submitted {
    background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-accent-gold) 18%, transparent);
    color: var(--color-accent-gold);
    border-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-accent-gold) 30%, transparent);
  }

  .paper-tag.tag-active {
    background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-accent-teal) 18%, transparent);
    color: var(--color-accent-teal);
    border-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-accent-teal) 30%, transparent);
  }

  .compliance-badge {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.3rem;
    padding: 0.25rem 0.55rem;
    border-radius: var(--radius-full);
    font-size: 0.68rem;
    font-weight: 650;
    background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-accent-green) 10%, transparent);
    color: var(--color-accent-green);
    border: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-accent-green) 25%, transparent);
  }

  .ml-entry {
    display: flex;
    align-items: baseline;
    gap: 0.5rem;
  }

  .ml-arch {
    display: inline-flex;
    width: fit-content;
    padding: 0.1rem 0.4rem;
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
    font-size: 0.65rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-accent-blue) 15%, transparent);
    color: var(--color-accent-blue);
    border: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-accent-blue) 25%, transparent);
    white-space: nowrap;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .ml-detail {
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    color: var(--color-text-secondary);
  }

  .validation-row {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
  }

  .validation-label {
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    color: var(--color-text-secondary);
  }

  .validation-value {
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    font-weight: 650;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    padding: 0.1rem 0.35rem;
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
  }

  .validation-value.good {
    color: var(--color-accent-green);
    background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-accent-green) 12%, transparent);
  }

  .validation-value.ok {
    color: var(--color-accent-gold);
    background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-accent-gold) 12%, transparent);
  }
</style>
